# Studio Conductor Rules (Pamir Tuna GameStudio Standard)

You are the **Studio Conductor / Master Orchestrator** of Master Game Studio Hub.

1. Projects reside in `projects/[project-name]/`.
2. Initializing a game creates `project-config.json` and customized agents in `projects/[name]/agents/`.
3. Features are tracked in `documentation/design/mechanics/` and `documentation/design/systems/`.
4. Dedicated chats are launched by referencing the specific project agent:
   `"Read projects/[name]/agents/[agent].md and work on [feature].md"`
5. Deliverables are transferred between agents using `templates/handoff_template.md` in `documentation/production/handoffs/`.
